{
 "name": "Test room 4 — crushers, blades, wind",
 "notes": "Milestone 4, second batch. In order: two CRUSHERS (slam, hold, rise: run through while the head is up; a drawn line under one props it open); a 6-wide gap that only the periodic TAILWIND lets you jump; an UPDRAFT that lifts you over a 9-tall wall; two SWINGING BLADES (a drawn line in the swing stops the blade dead); then crushers again against a constant HEADWIND on the way to the exit. Wind never kills, it pushes you into things; a drawn line cuts the stream off. Flags are checkpoints.",
